#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/anchor.html:6
#, kde-format
msgctxt "anchor.html:title"
msgid "Anchor"
msgstr "Áncora"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/anchor.html:9
#, kde-format
msgctxt "anchor.html:p"
msgid ""
"Anchor is a joint that fixes position of the body. The body can not move when "
"it has an anchor."
msgstr ""
"Unha áncora é unha articulación que fixa a posición do corpo. O corpo non pode"
" moverse mentres teña unha áncora."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/box.html:6
#, kde-format
msgctxt "box.html:title"
msgid "Box"
msgstr "Caixa"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/box.html:9
#, kde-format
msgctxt "box.html:p"
msgid "A rigid box with a unique name and the following parameters:"
msgstr "Unha caixa ríxida cun nome único e os seguintes parámetros:"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/box.html:21
#, kde-format
msgctxt "box.html:body"
msgid ""
"<ul>\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>position:</b> The X/Y position of the center of mass of the box, relati"
"ve to the center of the <a href=\"objinfo:World\">world</a>.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>angle:</b> By how much the box is rotated in positive direction, that i"
"s clock-wise.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>velocity:</b> The velocity of the center of mass of the box. Unit: mete"
"rs/second.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>angular velocity:</b> How fast the box is spinning in positive directio"
"n, that is clock-wise.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>mass:</b> Total mass of the box. This influences forces with which the "
"box interacts with other items.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>inertia:</b> How difficult it is to change the box's rotation.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>momentum:</b> A fundamental quantity in mechanics that is conserved in "
"the absence of external forces. A product of the mass and the velocity.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>angular momentum:</b> Measure of the extent to which the box will conti"
"nue to rotate unless acted upon by an external torque.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>kinetic energy:</b> The work needed to accelerate the body of a given m"
"ass from rest to its current velocity.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>size:</b> Defines width and height of the box.</li>"
"\n"
"\t</ul>"
msgstr ""
"<ul>\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>posición:</b> A posición en X e Y do centro de masa da caixa, relativa "
"ao centro do <a href=\"objinfo:World\">mundo</a>.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>ángulo:</b> A rotación da caixa no sentido das agullas do reloxo.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>velocidade:</b> A velocidade do centro de masa da caixa en metros por s"
"egundo.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>velocidade angular:</b> A velocidade de rotación da caixa no sentido da"
"s agullas do reloxo.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>masa:</b> A masa total da caixa, que influencia as forzas coa que a cai"
"xa interactúa con outros elementos.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>inercia:</b> A dificultade que supón cambiar a rotación da caixa.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>momento:</b> Unha cantidade fundamental da mecánica que se conserva ant"
"e a ausencia de forzas externas. É o produto da masa pola velocidade.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>momento angular:</b> A cantidade pola que a caixa seguirá xirando a men"
"os que un torque externo actúe sobre ela.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>enerxía cinética:</b> O traballo necesario para acelerar o corpo dunha "
"masa indicada do repouso á súa velocidade actual.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>tamaño:</b> A anchura e a altura da caixa.</li>"
"\n"
"\t</ul>"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/chargedparticle.html:6
#, kde-format
msgctxt "chargedparticle.html:title"
msgid "Charged Particle"
msgstr "Partícula cargada"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/chargedparticle.html:9
#, kde-format
msgctxt "chargedparticle.html:p"
msgid ""
"A zero-sized particle which carries an electric charge. It has a unique name a"
"nd five parameters:"
msgstr ""
"Unha partícula sen tamaño con carga eléctrica. Ten un nome único e cinco parám"
"etros:"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/chargedparticle.html:16
#, kde-format
msgctxt "chargedparticle.html:body"
msgid ""
"<ul>\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>position:</b> The X/Y position of the particle, relative to the center "
"of the <a href=\"objinfo:World\">world</a>.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>velocity:</b> the velocity of the particle. Unit: meters/second.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>force:</b> the force with which the particle is moving around.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>mass:</b> the mass of the particle. This influences forces with which t"
"he particle interacts with other items.</li>"
"\n"
" \t\t"
"<li><b>charge:</b> The amount of positive or negative electricity deposited on"
" the particle. Unit: Coulomb.</li>"
"\n"
"\t</ul>"
msgstr ""
"<ul>\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>posición:</b> A posición en X e Y partícula, relativa ao centro do <a h"
"ref=\"objinfo:World\">mundo</a>.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>velocidade:</b> A velocidade da partícula en metros por segundo.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>forza:</b> A forza coa que se move a partícula.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>masa:</b> A masa total da partícula, que influencia as forzas coa que a"
" partícula interactúa con outros elementos.</li>"
"\n"
" \t\t"
"<li><b>carga:</b> A cantidade de electricidade positiva ou negativa depositada"
" na partícula, en coulombs.</li>"
"\n"
"\t</ul>"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/coulombforce.html:6
#, kde-format
msgctxt "coulombforce.html:title"
msgid "Coulomb Force"
msgstr "Forza de Coulomb"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/coulombforce.html:9
#, kde-format
msgctxt "coulombforce.html:p"
msgid "Coulomb force is a force of interaction between charged particles."
msgstr ""
"Unha forza de Coulomb é unha forza de interacción entre dúas partículas cargad"
"as."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/coulombforce.html:10
#, kde-format
msgctxt "coulombforce.html:p"
msgid "<b>Coulomb's law</b>"
msgstr "<b>Lei de Coulomb</b>"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/coulombforce.html:11
#, kde-format
msgctxt "coulombforce.html:body"
msgid ""
"<li>The magnitude of the electrostatic force between two point electric charge"
"s is directly proportional to the product of the magnitudes of each of the cha"
"rges and inversely proportional to the square of the distance between the two "
"charges.</li>"
msgstr ""
"<li>A magnitude da forza electrostática entre dous puntos de carga eléctrica é"
" directamente proporcional ao produto das magnitudes de cada carga, e inversam"
"ente proporcional ao cadrado da distancia entre as cargas.</li>"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/coulombforce.html:12
#, kde-format
msgctxt "coulombforce.html:p"
msgid ""
"For more details, please refer to the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Coulomb's_law\">Coulomb Force</a>."
msgstr ""
"Para máis información, consulte <a href=\"https://gl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lei_de"
"_Coulomb\">Lei de Coulomb</a>."

