#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/gas.html:6
#, kde-format
msgctxt "gas.html:title"
msgid "Gas"
msgstr "Gas"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/gas.html:9
#, kde-format
msgctxt "gas.html:p"
msgid ""
"A gas is a collection of <a href=\"objinfo:GasParticle\">gasoline particles</a"
">. Associated with the gas is a <a href=\"objinfo:GasLJForce\">force</a>. To a"
"dd gas particles right-click the gas and click on \"Create particles\"."
msgstr ""
"Un gas é unha colección de <a href=\"objinfo:GasParticle\">partículas de gasol"
"ina</a>. Hai unha <a href=\"objinfo:GasLJForce\">forza</a> asociada co gas. Pa"
"ra engadir partículas de gas, faga clic dereito no gas e seleccione «Crear par"
"tículas»."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/gas.html:10
#, kde-format
msgctxt "gas.html:p"
msgid ""
"For details about the math used to calculate the forces, please refer to the <"
"a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lennard-Jones_potential\">Lennard-Jones"
" potential</a>."
msgstr ""
"Para información sobre as matemáticas que se usan para calcular as forzas, con"
"sulte <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lennard-Jones_potential\">Lennar"
"d-Jones potential</a> (en inglés)."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/gasljforce.html:6
#, kde-format
msgctxt "gasljforce.html:title"
msgid "Force"
msgstr "Forza"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/gasljforce.html:9
#, kde-format
msgctxt "gasljforce.html:p"
msgid ""
"This force simulates the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lennard-Jones"
"_potential\">Lennard-Jones potential</a>. There are three parameters for this "
"force:"
msgstr ""
"Esta forza simula o <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lennard-Jones_pote"
"ntial\">potencial de Lennard-Jones</a>. Ten tres parámetros:"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/gasljforce.html:14
#, kde-format
msgctxt "gasljforce.html:body"
msgid ""
"<ul>\n"
"        "
"<li><b>depth:</b> The minimum value of the Lennard-Jones potential well</li>"
"\n"
"        "
"<li><b>rmin:</b> The distance from the origin to the minimum of the potential<"
"/li>"
"\n"
"        "
"<li><b>cutoff:</b> The distance, where the Lennard-Jones (LJ) potential is oft"
"en truncated to save computational time</li>"
"\n"
"\t</ul>"
msgstr ""
"<ul>\n"
"        "
"<li><b>profundidade:</b> O valor mínimo do pozo de potencial de Lennard-Jones."
"</li>"
"\n"
"        "
"<li><b>rmin:</b> A distancia entre a orixe e o potencial mínimo.</li>"
"\n"
"        "
"<li><b>recorte:</b> A distancia a partir da cal o potencial de Lennard-Jones s"
"e recorta para aforrar tempo de computación.</li>"
"\n"
"\t</ul>"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/gasljforce.html:15
#, kde-format
msgctxt "gasljforce.html:p"
msgid ""
"These parameters are empirical and are usually obtained from experiment or som"
"e rough estimation."
msgstr ""
"Os parámetros son empíricos e adoitan obterse mediante experimentación ou apro"
"ximación."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/gasparticle.html:6
#, kde-format
msgctxt "gasparticle.html:title"
msgid "Gas Particle"
msgstr "Partícula de gas"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/gasparticle.html:9
#, kde-format
msgctxt "gasparticle.html:p"
msgid ""
"A <a href=\"objinfo:Gas\">gas</a> particle simulates one single particle in a "
"gasoline system. Each particle is tracked individually and has a unique name a"
"nd four parameters:"
msgstr ""
"Unha partícula de <a href=\"objinfo:Gas\">gas</a> simula unha partícula indivi"
"dual nun sistema de gasolina. Cada partícula ten un seguimento individual e te"
"n un nome único e catro parámetros:"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/gasparticle.html:15
#, kde-format
msgctxt "gasparticle.html:body"
msgid ""
"<ul>\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>position:</b> The X/Y position of the particle relative, to the center "
"of the <a href=\"objinfo:World\">world</a>.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>velocity:</b> the velocity of the particle. Unit: meters/second.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>force:</b> the force with which the particle is moving around.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>mass:</b> the mass of the particle. This influences forces with which t"
"he particle interacts with other items.</li>"
"\n"
"\t</ul>"
msgstr ""
"<ul>\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>posición:</b> A posición en X e Y partícula, relativa ao centro do <a h"
"ref=\"objinfo:World\">mundo</a>.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>velocidade:</b> A velocidade da partícula en metros por segundo.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>forza:</b> A forza coa que se move a partícula.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t"
"<li><b>masa:</b> A masa total da partícula, que influencia as forzas coa que a"
" partícula interactúa con outros elementos.</li>"
"\n"
" \t\t"
"<li><b>carga:</b> A cantidade de electricidade positiva ou negativa depositada"
" na partícula, en coulombs.</li>"
"\n"
"\t</ul>"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/gravitationforce.html:6
#, kde-format
msgctxt "gravitationforce.html:title"
msgid "Gravitation Force"
msgstr "Forza gravitacional"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/gravitationforce.html:9
#, kde-format
msgctxt "gravitationforce.html:p"
msgid ""
"Gravitational force is an attractive force that act between bodies having mass"
"."
msgstr ""
"A forza gravitacional é unha forza atractiva que actúa entre corpos que teñen "
"masa."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/gravitationforce.html:10
#, kde-format
msgctxt "gravitationforce.html:p"
msgid "<b>Newton's law</b>"
msgstr "<b>Lei de Newton</b>"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/gravitationforce.html:11
#, kde-format
msgctxt "gravitationforce.html:body"
msgid ""
"<li>Every body in the universe attracts every other body with a force, which i"
"s proportional to the product of the masses of the bodies and inversely propor"
"tional to square of the distance between them.</li>"
msgstr ""
"<li>Todo corpo do universo atrae ao resto de corpos cunha forza, proporcional "
"ao produto das masas dos corpos, e inversamente proporcional ao cadrado da dis"
"tancia entre eles.</li>"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/gravitationforce.html:12
#, kde-format
msgctxt "gravitationforce.html:p"
msgid "<b>General relativity</b>"
msgstr "<b>Relatividade xeral</b>"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/gravitationforce.html:13
#, kde-format
msgctxt "gravitationforce.html:body"
msgid ""
"<li>In general relativity gravitation is explained on the basis of curvature o"
"f space-time.</li>"
msgstr ""
"<li>Na relatividade xeral, a gravitación explícase en base á curva espazo-temp"
"oral.</li>"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/gravitationforce.html:14
#, kde-format
msgctxt "gravitationforce.html:p"
msgid ""
"For more details, please refer to the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Gravitation\">Gravitation Force</a>."
msgstr ""
"Para máis información, consulte <a href=\"https://gl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gravid"
"ade\">Gravidade</a>."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/linearmotor.html:6
#, kde-format
msgctxt "linearmotor.html:title"
msgid "Linear Motor"
msgstr "Motor linear"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/linearmotor.html:9
#, kde-format
msgctxt "linearmotor.html:p"
msgid "A linear motor produces a linear force along its length."
msgstr "Un motor linear produce unha forza linear ao longo da súa lonxitude."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/linearmotor.html:10
#, kde-format
msgctxt "linearmotor.html:p"
msgid ""
"You can set the desired linear force for an object by changing the force value"
" in the properties browser."
msgstr ""
"Pode cambiar o valor da forza no navegador de propiedades para definir a forza"
" linear desexada dun obxecto."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/meter.html:6
#, kde-format
msgctxt "meter.html:title"
msgid "Meter"
msgstr "Metro"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/meter.html:9
#, kde-format
msgctxt "meter.html:p"
msgid ""
"A meter can show you values of properties. The meter can be configured to show"
" property of any given object of the simulation."
msgstr ""
"Un metro pode amosar valores de propiedades. O metro pode configurarse para am"
"osar unha propiedade dun obxecto indicado da simulación."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: objectinfo/note.html:6
#, kde-format
